    + rewrite (cview_none_shape p1 0 E1).
      exact firez_C1_1RB1LA_1LC1RD_1LC1LA_0LA0RB.
    + exact (fireo_1RB1LA_1LC1RD_1LC1LA_0LA0RB [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 2 0; SWin 8; SCycR 2; SWin 2; SRotL 1; SWin 1] (StC, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1' E1).
