    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LA_1LC1RD_1LD0RB_0LA1RC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LA_1LC1RD_1LD0RB_0LA1RC p j' E).
    + lia.
