Module LAPT_1RB1LA_1RC1RD_0LC0LA_0LD0RB.
(** * LAPT_1RB1LA_1RC1RD_0LC0LA_0LD0RB: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1LA_1RC1RD_0LC0LA_0LD0RB, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

